ies, is actually steeped in stories, inhabited by people who have no idea what's going on around them and whose relationship to space is radically different...\nThe player embodies a land surveyor who explores a rural territory and must make choices that will have an impact on diplomacy, but also on the local population. The game combines visual novel phases and observational puzzles \u2014 the two aspects nourishing each other to modify the plot of an interactive story.", "themes": [{"id": 22, "name": "Historical"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/beware-of-the-cartographer", "videos": [{"id": 177060, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "z7eanjDlZvA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z7eanjDlZvA", "title": "Beware of the Cartographer! Announcement Trailer \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/z7eanjDlZvA/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}